{"pageProps":{"posts":[{"id":"194e285c-2a97-4efc-bd75-78a0424f5639","rawId":"194e285c2a974efcbd7578a0424f5639","slug":"194e285c2a974efcbd7578a0424f5639","title":"Tmux 使用指南 🚀: 提升你的终端体验","date":"2024-04-03","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"Tmux（Terminal Multiplexer）作为一个终端复用的利器，它不仅能够极大提高我们的工作效率，还能在多个任务和会话之间实现无缝切换。下面，我将为你提供一个更为详细的Tmux使用指南，帮助你更加深入地掌握这一强大工具。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"Tmux（Terminal Multiplexer）作为一个终端复用的利器，它不仅能够极大提高我们的工作效率，还能在多个任务和会话之间实现无缝切换。下面，我将为你提供一个更为详细的Tmux使用指南，帮助你更加深入地掌握这一强大工具。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"5ac0f906-5fbc-4b46-a4d9-e4a262ad8d59","name":"tmux","color":"red"},{"id":"301c75ae-949a-4a02-a6b8-70e55bba40a3","name":"Kali Linux","color":"pink"},{"id":"c2d30c8f-feaa-40fd-948a-8323eb7098b6","name":"Linux","color":"default"},{"id":"25b1074b-a3fa-49f5-82cd-a37d85c5666f","name":"工具","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"94d99ca6-6e01-4f3f-bf75-1cc4b301962e","rawId":"94d99ca66e014f3fbf751cc4b301962e","slug":"94d99ca66e014f3fbf751cc4b301962e","title":"巧妙解决黑苹果与Windows系统时间不同步","date":"2024-03-21","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"巧妙解决黑苹果与Windows系统时间不同步","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"巧妙解决黑苹果与Windows系统时间不同步","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"c018054e-510e-42b6-8e7a-6133ef96add6","name":"黑苹果","color":"purple"},{"id":"4ec566a6-3747-4f95-88f7-212cf55a4283","name":"Windows","color":"gray"},{"id":"ffad0683-a466-458d-a441-cd7df9532a48","name":"时间不同步","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"66943e1c-2cec-4b01-ac41-6e42c1fcc2fc","rawId":"66943e1c2cec4b01ac416e42c1fcc2fc","slug":"66943e1c2cec4b01ac416e42c1fcc2fc","titl