","text":{"content":"高效学习四大方法","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"高效学习四大方法","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"a4dcd33a-34a7-4c33-b9c2-92d3a5248f06","name":"学习思考","color":"pink"}],"categoryNames":["学习思考"],"tags":[{"id":"e690aac7-2568-486e-8a9f-0c53bb08065f","name":"study","color":"purple"},{"id":"97044593-8574-42b4-9e9e-ab6a6b9644e5","name":"深度学习","color":"green"},{"id":"12caa208-8ad8-44cd-939c-cd338af22949","name":"方法","color":"default"}]},{"id":"8b111a7c-e066-4b52-ac02-1def3badab8e","rawId":"8b111a7ce0664b52ac021def3badab8e","slug":"8b111a7ce0664b52ac021def3badab8e","title":"SQL入门指南","date":"2023-10-30","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"SQL（Structured Query Language）是一种用于管理和操作关系型数据库的编程语言。通过使用SQL，用户可以执行各种数据库操作，如创建、修改和删除数据库表，插入、更新和删除数据，以及查询和检索数据。SQLMap 是一款开源的自动化 SQL 注入和数据库接管工具。它专门用于检测和利用 Web 应用程序中的 SQL 注入漏洞。通过使用 SQLMap，用户可以自动化地发现和利用 SQL 注入漏洞，从而获取对目标数据库的访问权限。OWASP Top 10 是一个由 OWASP（开放式 Web 应用安全项目）组织发布的关于 Web 应用程序安全风险的指南。它列出了当前最常见的十种 Web 应用程序安全风险，帮助开发人员和安全专业人员了解并解决这些风险。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"SQL（Structured Query Language）是一种用于管理和操作关系型数据库的编程语言。通过使用SQL，用户可以执行各种数据库操作，如创建、修改和删除数据库表，插入、更新和删除数据，以及查询和检索数据。SQLMap 是一款开源的自动化 SQL 注入和数据库接管工具。它专门用于检测和利用 Web 应用程序中的 SQL 注入漏洞。通过使用 SQLMap，用户可以自动化地发现和利用 SQL 注入漏洞，从而获取对目标数据库的访问权限。OWASP Top 10 是一个由 OWASP（开放式 Web 应用安全项目）组织发布的关于 Web 应用程序安全风险的指南。它列出了当前最常见的十种 Web 应用程序安全风险，帮助开发人员和安全专业人员了解并解决这些风险。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"39ae49a8-e39b-4658-b9b9-92ec1f2427ff","name":"SQL","color":"gray"},{"id":"71dbd874-84b0-47c3-949c-454aa2c9e823","name":"SQL注入","color":"gray"},{"id":"745c1593-9d22-4618-b933-128d153597e2","name":"SQL injection","color":"default"},{"id":"16a82bbe-9aaa-4a80-8dea-e50acd1507c7","name":"sqlmap","color":"brown"},{"id":"25b1074b-a3fa-49f5-82cd-a37d85c5666f","name":"工具","color":"pink"},{"id":"301c75ae-949a-4a02-a6b8-70e55bba40a3","name":"Kali Linux","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"5f2be223-1b15-4d38-af83-434e72f57143","rawId":"5f2be2231b154d38af83434e72f57143","slug":"5f2be2231b154d38af83434e72f57143","title":" 几行代码搞定屏幕录像","date":"2023-10-26","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"python几行代码搞定屏幕录像","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"python几行代码搞定屏幕录像","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"abdea974-dc43-48be-b628-3642f38580c1","name":"python","color":"blue"},{"id":"25b1074b-a3fa-49f5-82cd-a37d85c5666f","name":"工具","color":"pink"},{"id":"1e90f00e-8f1b-4665-8e69-92f0791bde56","name":"开发","color":"pink"},{"id":"e3e1eebf-13a3-41f6-8b52-e348479be981","name":"录像","color":"purple"}]},{"id":"535c27ca-64b7-4014-a563-0ee1b5be1fdd","rawId":"535c27ca64b74014a5630ee1b5be1fdd","slug":"535c27ca64b74014a5630ee1b5be1fdd","title":"常见恶意代码类型","date":"2023-10-21","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"恶意代码（Malicious Code）是指那些未经用户授权，破坏计算机系统、窃取数据或者干扰计算机正常运行的计算机程序。恶意代码通常具有隐蔽性、传播性和破坏性等特点，可以通过网络、移动存储设备等途径传播，给个人和组织带来严重的损失。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"恶意代码（Malicious Code）是指那些未经用户授权，破坏计算机系统、窃取数据或者干扰计算机正常运行的计算机程序。恶意代码通常具有隐蔽性、传播性和破坏性等特点，可以通过网络、移动存储设备等途径传播，给个人和组织带来严重的损失。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"aded2429-9525-4441-a515-0cd3d1f062f0","name":"漏洞","color":"default"},{"id":"575fdb60-0da0-4e94-8c2f-ab1d315435de","name":"情报","color":"default"},{"id":"9652a69a-2498-4c02-b404-bc9180bf1ffc","name":"黑客","color":"pink"},{"id":"ea751af3-f527-46b7-8c67-e35299326f7c","name":"技术","color":"purple"},{"id":"6b36a096-0ed1-4843-ba62-7a9eda12b6d9","name":"木马","color":"green"},{"id":"a3e2e608-280d-4dab-958f-95f9edcdae7c","name":"蠕虫","color":"pink"},{"id":"437201a9-422a-4d7c-985c-8561839823d9","name":"类","color":"blue"},{"id":"e4d05b89-a0ab-4b2b-9262-97f10bd060a0","name":"恶意代码","color":"orange"},{"id":"97df18df-e524-4742-9ec6-011628575bde","name":"科技威胁","color":"green"},{"id":"c225af5f-5631-4b18-8495-9fa6f89597c5","name":"网络攻击","color":"brown"},{"id":"8edfdf00-d304-40ee-9e06-a66936d32d99","name":"僵尸网络","color":"blue"},{"id":"0a04f60b-579d-4147-a657-4d46f01ce06c","name":"恶意软件","color":"blue"}]},{"id":"45832fc0-1496-4e15-8fa3-4fbd2acd90ea","rawId":"45832fc014964e158fa34fbd2acd90ea","slug":"45832fc014964e158fa34fbd2acd90ea","title":"信息收集手册","date":"2023-10-19","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"信息收集是一个关键的环节，它涉及从各种来源获取和分析数据，以便更好地了解潜在的安全威胁和漏洞。知己知彼，百战不殆。在网络安全领域，了解攻击者可能使用的工具、技术和策略是至关重要的。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"信息收集是一个关键的环节，它涉及从各种来源获取和分析数据，以便更好地了解潜在的安全威胁和漏洞。知己知彼，百战不殆。在网络安全领域，了解攻击者可能使用的工具、技术和策略是至关重要的。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"25b1074b-a3fa-49f5-82cd-a37d85c5666f","name":"工具","color":"pink"},{"id":"575fdb60-0da0-4e94-8c2f-ab1d315435de","name":"情报","color":"default"},{"id":"aded2429-9525-4441-a515-0cd3d1f062f0","name":"漏洞","color":"default"},{"id":"9bfe9e7d-adb2-45b6-902b-15bad6ffabcb","name":"网站","color":"gray"},{"id":"ea751af3-f527-46b7-8c67-e35299326f7c","name":"技术","color":"purple"},{"id":"9652a69a-2498-4c02-b404-bc9180bf1ffc","name":"黑客","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"0a7d9fdc-b2db-44d5-b4a9-826192955f1e","rawId":"0a7d9fdcb2db44d5b4a9826192955f1e","slug":"0a7d9fdcb2db44d5b4a9826192955f1e","title":"NMAP入门指南","date":"2023-10-18","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"Nmap，全称为Network Mapper，是一种网络连接端扫描软件，最早源于Linux系统下的网络扫描和嗅探工具包。它的主要功能是扫描网上电脑开放的网络连接端，确定哪些服务运行在哪些连接端，并能推断计算机运行的操作系统。此外，Nmap还具有漏洞检测、网络分析、安全审核等多种功能。对于网络安全的学习和研究，Nmap是一个非常重要的工具。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"Nmap，全称为Network Mapper，是一种网络连接端扫描软件，最早源于Linux系统下的网络扫描和嗅探工具包。它的主要功能是扫描网上电脑开放的网络连接端，确定哪些服务运行在哪些连接端，并能推断计算机运行的操作系统。此外，Nmap还具有漏洞检测、网络分析、安全审核等多种功能。对于网络安全的学习和研究，Nmap是一个非常重要的工具。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"25b1074b-a3fa-49f5-82cd-a37d85c5666f","name":"工具","color":"pink"},{"id":"575fdb60-0da0-4e94-8c2f-ab1d315435de","name":"情报","color":"default"},{"id":"ea751af3-f527-46b7-8c67-e35299326f7c","name":"技术","color":"purple"},{"id":"9652a69a-2498-4c02-b404-bc9180bf1ffc","name":"黑客","color":"pink"},{"id":"b670ff18-3664-49cc-9039-569aff704bee","name":"nmap","color":"default"},{"id":"6d8bed57-2dfe-4f91-af29-3c979861e620","name":"信息收集","color":"brown"}]},{"id":"8daa1610-a3f2-4b65-bea0-c7c6fb8ac26e","rawId":"8daa1610a3f24b65bea0c7c6fb8ac26e","slug":"8daa1610a3f24b65bea0c7c6fb8ac26e","title":"一张图搞懂英语语法","date":"2023-10-11","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"一张图搞懂英语语法，主、谓、宾、定、状、补、表、同位","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"一张图搞懂英语语法，主、谓、宾、定、状、补、表、同位","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"a4dcd33a-34a7-4c33-b9c2-92d3a5248f06","name":"学习思考","color":"pink"}],"categoryNames":["学习思考"],"tags":[{"id":"d8156fe9-e2c2-4d8e-9a92-92824a650453","name":"图片","color":"orange"},{"id":"438bae9c-df52-4fb0-8288-791c5ee8625c","name":"思考","color":"yellow"},{"id":"52d3530d-b5ea-422e-85d9-7ddfc87427c5","name":"英语","color":"purple"},{"id":"fccda0e1-b8c2-4e1c-ae34-107cc4712e37","name":"语言","color":"green"},{"id":"50f03e8e-f38d-4237-9693-9f12fb33aa91","name":"语法","color":"yellow"}]}